# Check out LF everywhere, so a working copy is byte-identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The corpus and its snapshots are hashed in run manifests and gated by the
# confirmatory launcher, so checkout must never rewrite their bytes. Under
# core.autocrlf the same corpus hashes to 880cf414 (LF) or 7f0f3155 (CRLF).
data/*.json -text
data/archive/*.json -text
outputs/raw/**/scenario_snapshot.json -text

# Shipped run artifacts. run_manifest.json records the sha256 of results.jsonl
# and its siblings under status.observed_files, so checkout must not rewrite
# their bytes -- an eol conversion would silently invalidate every hash a
# reviewer checks.
outputs/raw/** -text
